{'symbol': 'HSIC', 'date': '2023-06-20 06:30:00', 'title': 'HENRY SCHEIN MEDICAL JOINS DEFIBTECH AND THE PROFESSIONAL FOOTBALL ATHLETIC TRAINERS SOCIETY FOUNDATION TO DONATE AUTOMATED EXTERNAL DEFIBRILLATORS FOR YOUNG ATHLETES ACROSS THE COUNTRY', 'text': 'MELVILLE, N.Y.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HENRY SCHEIN MEDICAL, THE U.S. MEDICAL BUSINESS OF HENRY SCHEIN, INC. (NASDAQ: HSIC), DEFIBTECH, AND THE PROFESSIONAL FOOTBALL ATHLETIC TRAINERS SOCIETY FOUNDATION INC. (PFATS FOUNDATION), ARE COMING TOGETHER TO DONATE AND DISTRIBUTE AUTOMATED EXTERNAL DEFIBRILLATORS (AEDS). RECOGNIZING THE IMPORTANCE OF HAVING AEDS READILY AVAILABLE FOR STUDENT ATHLETES, THE PFATS FOUNDATION LAUNCHED AN APPLICATION PROCESS WHERE LOCAL HIGH SCHOOLS, MIDDLE SCHOOLS, AND YOUTH SPO.'}